#
# Story 6.4 — Contextual help (FAQ)
#
WizardNeedHelp=Need help?
WizardHelpDocLink=Full documentation
WizardHelp1Q_step1=Where can I find the Doli2Shop app on Shopify?
WizardHelp1A_step1=Go to the <a href="https://apps.shopify.com/doli2shop" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Shopify App Store</a> and install the Doli2Shop app on your store.
WizardHelp2Q_step1=Why does the connection fail?
WizardHelp2A_step1=Check that: 1) Your server uses HTTPS, 2) The app is installed, 3) Your browser does not block popups.
WizardHelp3Q_step1=Can I connect multiple Shopify stores?
WizardHelp3A_step1=Yes, by using Dolibarr's multi-entity mode. Each entity can be connected to a different store.
WizardHelp1Q_step2=Which direction should I choose for products?
WizardHelp1A_step2=If your products are created in Shopify, choose "Shopify to Dolibarr". If you create products in Dolibarr, choose "Dolibarr to Shopify". Bidirectional mode synchronizes both ways.
WizardHelp2Q_step2=Are orders synchronized automatically?
WizardHelp2A_step2=Yes, thanks to Shopify webhooks. Each paid order automatically creates an order and a draft invoice in Dolibarr.
WizardHelp3Q_step2=Can I change these settings later?
WizardHelp3A_step2=Yes, from the module's Configuration > Synchronization Directions page.
WizardHelp1Q_step3=How long does synchronization take?
WizardHelp1A_step3=About 10 products per second. For 100 products, expect about 10 seconds.
WizardHelp2Q_step3=What happens if synchronization fails?
WizardHelp2A_step3=You can relaunch it as many times as needed. Already synchronized products will not be duplicated.
WizardHelp3Q_step3=Will existing products in Dolibarr be overwritten?
WizardHelp3A_step3=No, products are updated if a product with the same SKU already exists. No data is lost.
WizardHelp4Q_step3=Can I relaunch the sync later?
WizardHelp4A_step3=Yes, from the module's Product Synchronization page. The wizard is also re-runnable.
