ImageDuplicatesCleanupIntro=Before the 2026-09-07 fix, every Shopify sync (the "products/update" webhook in particular) re-copied all of the product's photos under a randomly generated name (uniqid()): none of them could recognize the file dropped by the previous sync. This tool identifies these duplicates and lets you delete them after a preview.
